Instruction of creating a .jar file
1.	Navigate to Main class

2.	Run the code

3.	Open terminal and type this command:
javac -d out -cp src src/prototype/wong_xin_thung/Main.java

4.	Type this command:
jar cfe SantoriniGame.jar prototype.wong_xin_thung.Main -C out .

5.	Type this command:
java -jar SantoriniGame.jar
